OL,3,AYou Can See Everything seen by many on
OL,4,Ahuge box office debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-hour documentary featuring the
OL,7,Fconvicted tech fraudster Elizabeth
OL,8,FHolmes has raked in a whopping $15
OL,9,Fmillion (#11.25m) on its box office
OL,10,Fdebut, despite a limited run at 855
OL,11,Fscreens across the US and Canada.
OL,13,FThe eagerly anticipated film, You Can
OL,14,FSee Everything, finds Holmes letting
OL,15,Ffilmmakers into her California home in
OL,16,F2023, during the month before she began
OL,17,Fan 11-year prison sentence.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
