OL,3,AYou Can See Everything seen by many on
OL,4,Ahuge box office debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was co-directed by comedian Nathan
OL,7,FFielder and Lance Oppenheim who find
OL,8,Fthemselves embroiled in the story,
OL,9,Fgrowing suspicious that Holmes and her
OL,10,Fpartner are withholding information.
OL,12,FUS publication Deadline noted the film
OL,13,Fhad enjoyed "easily the second best
OL,14,Fopening ever for a [non-music]
OL,15,Fdocumentary at the box office", after
OL,16,FMichael Moore's 2004 film Fahrenheit
OL,17,F9/11, about the US's invasion of Iraq.
